      "error_message": "Validator blocks questions where VLM emits 'A)' as correct_option_label \u2014 'A)' not in ('A','B','C','D')",
      "file": "backend/app/routers/ingest.py",
      "root_cause": "VLMs (granite3.2-vision, qwen-vl family) frequently output answer labels with trailing parentheses ('A)', 'B.') or lowercase ('a'). _normalize_extracted_questions passed labels through verbatim, causing every such question to fail the blocking validator check.",
